   "body": "/claim mac/m4-captures\n\nOperator decisions of 2026-11-10, as relayed by the main session:\n- **Step 1, storage creation:** one storage creation send to `MultiMP` from user2 is allowed. It is an exception to LOT-001's N01 rule, for this one send only. The main session sends it, with legacy's exact body (`MPStorage.m:738-746` and `:785-832` @ `87fe0d1c`), at user2's next new-MP window.\n- **Step 3, storage write answer:** on user2's new storage thread, with its document unchanged, not on user1's real document. Kit accounts only.\n- **Step 2, edit form of a deleted storage message:** user2 deletes its new storage thread, then GETs its edit form. Kit accounts only.\n- **Step 4, editing another account's message:** user2 submits the edit form of user1's first message in a fixture thread between the two kit accounts. A refusal is expected.\n\nAll gated at one request per minute; one draft PR `capture/440-mpstorage-answers`.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
