   "body": "**Capture result** (mac/m4-captures): all four steps are done and in PR #758 (Closes #440). The independent leak check passed.\n\n| Step | Capture | HFR's answer |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1. Storage creation, user2 → `MultiMP` (sent by the main session) | `W440a` | \"Votre message a été posté avec succès !\" (the `W10` answer) |\n| 3. Storage write, document unchanged | `W440b` | \"Votre message a été édité avec succès !\" (the `W15` answer) |\n| 2. Storage edit form, read by another account while the thread exists | `R440a` | \"Ce message ne vous est pas destiné, désolé\", no form (`RA5`) |\n| 2. Storage edit form after user2 deleted the thread, read by the owner / by another account | `R440b` / `R440c` | the same page |\n| 4. user2's edit POST of user1's first message in `fixture-test-9` | `W440c` | \"Vous n'avez pas les droits pour éditer ce message !\" (link-less `.hop`) |\n\n- user2's storage thread is deleted.\n- `fixture-test-9` is kept for #333.\n- Follow-up #756: the classifier reads `W440c` as `unrecognized` (reported unconfirmed), not `rejected`.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_\n",
